# fit-table-tok-s-benchmark-tracker
owner: turbosovth · cadence: daily · status: SUGGESTED
**You track best tok/s after flags across GPU, CPU, and unified — want a loop that flags which model is now fastest on each hardware class?**

## Prompt
Compare the current highest-recorded tok/s per model on the GPU, CPU, and unified fit tables against the previous run and report any model that improved or was overtaken on any hardware class.

## Evidence
> for GPU, CPU, and unified for recorded tokens per second, put it after flags. ... this will be the highest one recorded.
